  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [happypack](https://github.com/amireh/happypack) from `v4.0.0` to `v4.0.1`\n\n**Note**: This PR was created on a configured schedule (\"every weekend\" in timezone `Europe/Paris`) and will not receive updates outside those times.\n\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n\n#### v4.0.1\n-   [`8ef7852`](https://github.com/amireh/happypack/commit/8ef785245159bcefa9e394ee5eddc0e584796933) Release 4.0.0\n-   [`f5618f7`](https://github.com/amireh/happypack/commit/f5618f7f0b55ccc2ada4face84a1c747c58e9a46) update README\n-   [`f153db5`](https://github.com/amireh/happypack/commit/f153db542a3a97ea27557b1c24e7b11c4722db1b) update README.md with webpack loaders configuration according to the official docs\n-   [`e615555`](https://github.com/amireh/happypack/commit/e6155557cb958a68f472e73360156fd65ac16de1) Ignore cache-loader directory when publishing\n-   [`b529471`](https://github.com/amireh/happypack/commit/b52947144dc62af938c874bf1a61c2147cfd42b4) Release 4.0.1\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovateapp.com).",
